{'symbol': 'CSGP', 'date': '2022-09-12 09:00:00', 'title': 'COSTAR GROUP IS SELECTED FOR INCLUSION IN THE S&P 500 INDEX, JOINING A PREMIER GROUP OF SOME OF THE LARGEST AND MOST SUCCESSFUL COMPANIES IN THE WORLD', 'text': 'WASHINGTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--COSTAR GROUP (NASDAQ: CSGP), A LEADING PROVIDER OF ONLINE REAL ESTATE MARKETPLACES, INFORMATION, AND ANALYTICS IN THE COMMERCIAL AND RESIDENTIAL PROPERTY MARKETS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE COMPANY HAS BEEN SELECTED FOR INCLUSION IN THE S&P 500 INDEX, EFFECTIVE PRIOR TO THE OPENING OF TRADING ON MONDAY, SEPTEMBER 19, 2022. WIDELY RECOGNIZED AS ONE OF THE PREMIER BENCHMARKS OF THE U.S. EQUITIES MARKET, THE S&P 500 INDEX IS COMPRISED OF 500 LEADING COMPANIES ACR'}